/// M30 HISTORY-042 "Toolchain freeze: run shape".
/// Source: tests/baseline/baseline_test.go symbol
/// TestBaselineToolchainMatchesFreeze (L68-102): load
/// plus task/date guard (L70-74); bun version leg
/// (L76-77); bun revision leg (L79-80); go parse plus
/// floor legs (L82-92); sha leg (L94-95); ancestor leg
/// (L97-100).
/// Disposition: consolidate (this row ports
/// TestBaselineToolchainMatchesFreeze to ordinary Can
/// functions; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row,
/// variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the live run shape: the test
/// name, the loadJSON open, the seven refusal wordings
/// in leg order, the Fatalf call, the goVer/minor
/// bindings, the dir set, and the fatal/run/bun-leg
/// counts.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): test-name
/// pins TestBaselineToolchainMatchesFreeze (L68);
/// load-call pins the full load spelling (L71);
/// task-fatal pins the task/date inner bytes (L74);
/// bun-version-fatal pins the version inner bytes
/// (L77); bun-revision-fatal pins the revision inner
/// bytes (L80); unparseable-fatal pins the
/// unparseable inner bytes (L85); go-below-fatal pins
